Bwe bakugambanga nti, “Tugende ffenna twesanyuse,
    tunyage, tubbe n’okutta;
    tokkirizanga;

Engero za Sulemaani:
  Omwana ow’amagezi asanyusa kitaawe;
    naye omwana omusirusiru anakuwaza nnyina.

Totunuulira wayini ng’amyuse,
    bw’atemaganira mu ggiraasi
    ng’akka empolampola;

Amazima n’ekisa tobyerabiranga;
    byesibe mu bulago bwo,
    obiwandiike ku mutima gwo.

Amaaso ag’amalala,
    emimwa egirimba,
    okuttira abantu obwereere;

Okutya Mukama kwe kukyawa ekibi;
    nkyawa amalala n’okwemanya,
    n’obuteeyisa bulungi n’enjogera ey’obubambaavu.
